.TH NETOFDOTS 1
.SH NAME
netofdots \- dot net pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/netofdots
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I NetOfDots
is a dot net pattern.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Draws a radiating net of lines. Space repaints.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space
Repaint
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/netofdots.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
